  "description": "FB-V1 benchmark FL15. Customers receive a confirmation email when their order is confirmed: when an order with a customer email address is updated into Confirmed status, send a confirmation email (Flow core Send Email action) to that address. The effect leaves no queryable record trace by design \u2014 this is the benchmark's evidence-limit control, deliberately co-triggered on the same transition as FL04, FL11 and FL13.",
